er-from-retrieved-documents?mode=chat","line":111},{"title":"Вложения","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/embeddings/what-are-embeddings","line":113},{"title":"«Использование поиска на основе внедрений для реализации эффективного поиска знаний» .","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-use-embeddings-based-search-to-implement-efficient-knowledge-retrieval","line":113},{"title":"Тактика: попросите модель ответить цитатами из справочного текста.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-instruct-the-model-to-answer-with-citations-from-a-reference-text","line":117},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-answer-with-citation?mode=chat","line":125},{"title":"Стратегия: разбивайте сложные задачи на более простые подзадачи.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/strategy-split-complex-tasks-into-simpler-subtasks","line":129},{"title":"Тактика: используйте классификацию намерений, чтобы определить наиболее релевантные инструкции для запроса пользователя.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-use-intent-classification-to-identify-the-most-relevant-instructions-for-a-user-query","line":133},{"title":"см. информацию о ценах","target":"https://openai.com/pricing","line":135},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-decomposition-by-intent-classification-1?mode=chat","line":143},{"title":"Open in Playground","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-decomposition-by-intent-classification-2?mode=chat","line":151},{"title":"Tactic: For dialogue applications that require very long conversations, summarize or filter previous dialogue","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-for-dialogue-applications-that-require-very-long-conversations-summarize-or-filter-previous-dialogue","line":157},{"title":"«Использование поиска на основе вложений для реализации эффективного поиска знаний»","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-use-embeddings-based-search-to-implement-efficient-knowledge-retrieval","line":163},{"title":"Тактика: суммируйте длинные документы по частям и рекурсивно создайте полное резюме.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-summarize-long-documents-piecewise-and-construct-a-full-summary-recursively","line":167},{"title":"исследованиях","target":"https://openai.com/research/summarizing-books","line":171},{"title":"Стратегия: дайте моделям время «подумать».","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/strategy-give-models-time-to-think","line":175},{"title":"Тактика: поручите модели найти собственное решение, прежде чем спешить с выводами.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-instruct-the-model-to-work-out-its-own-solution-before-rushing-to-a-conclusion","line":179},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-rushing-to-a-conclusion?mode=chat","line":189},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-avoid-rushing-to-a-conclusion?mode=chat","line":199},{"title":"Тактика: используйте внутренний монолог или последовательность вопросов, чтобы скрыть процесс рассуждения модели.","target":"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/prompt-engineering/tactic-use-inner-monologue-or-a-sequence-of-queries-to-hide-the-model-s-reasoning-process","line":203},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-inner-monologue?mode=chat","line":213},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform.openai.com/playground/p/default-query-sequence-2?mode=chat","line":225},{"title":"Открыть на детской площадке","target":"https://platform